{
  "title": "Pairtrade overview",
  "uid": "pairtrade-overview",
  "tags": [
    "pairtrade",
    "bot"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "z-score + position state (per pair / variant)",
      "description": "Combined view: z-score lines (left scale) plus per-variant position-state bars overlaid at fixed Y levels (canary a=3.5, main a=3.0, main b=2.5, main c=2.0). Position bars are `(pairtrade_has_position == 1) * Y_offset` rendered as thick step lines so the same panel timeline aligns z and position on identical x-pixels.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace(pairtrade_z{instance!~\"debot-tokyo.*\",variant!=\"\"}, \"host\", \"canary\", \"instance\", \"debot-frankfurt-canary\"), \"host\", \"main\", \"instance\", \"debot-frankfurt\")",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} {{variant}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "(pairtrade_has_position{instance=\"debot-frankfurt-canary\",variant=\"a\"} == 1) * 3.5",
          "legendFormat": "canary a pos",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "(pairtrade_has_position{instance=\"debot-frankfurt\",variant=\"a\"} == 1) * 3.0",
          "legendFormat": "main a pos",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "(pairtrade_has_position{instance=\"debot-frankfurt\",variant=\"b\"} == 1) * 2.5",
          "legendFormat": "main b pos",
          "refId": "D"
        },
        {
          "expr": "(pairtrade_has_position{instance=\"debot-frankfurt\",variant=\"c\"} == 1) * 2.0",
          "legendFormat": "main c pos",
          "refId": "E"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": -4,
          "max": 4,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisWidth": 120
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "canary.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#FF66FF"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^main a.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^main b.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^main c.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*pos$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineInterpolation",
                "value": "stepAfter"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 30
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.spanNulls",
                "value": false
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "z-score divergence: Frankfurt A/B/C - canary (per variant)",
      "description": "Frankfurt main z minus Frankfurt canary z, broadcast on pair (group_left) so canary's single series compares against each of A/B/C. Structural drift is expected per bot-strategy#410 (separate process, independent WS bar close); the panel is a direction indicator for binary-regression detection rather than a 'should be 0' alert. Requires canary added to Alloy scrape with instance=\"debot-frankfurt-canary\".",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pairtrade_z{instance=\"debot-frankfurt\",variant!=\"\"} - on(pair) group_left pairtrade_z{instance=\"debot-frankfurt-canary\",variant!=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{variant}} {{pair}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1.0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "|beta_s - beta_l| (threshold 0.30)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pairtrade_beta_divergence{instance!~\"debot-tokyo.*\",variant!=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{variant}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.3
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Variants currently in position",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (instance) (pairtrade_has_position{instance!~\"debot-tokyo.*\",variant!=\"\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "gray",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Position age (seconds, > 0 only while in position)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pairtrade_position_age_seconds{instance!~\"debot-tokyo.*\",variant!=\"\"} > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{variant}} {{pair}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Eligibility (cointegration filter)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 30
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pairtrade_eligible{instance!~\"debot-tokyo.*\",variant!=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{variant}} {{pair}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "mergeValues": true,
        "showValue": "never",
        "rowHeight": 0.9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "text": "NOT ELIGIBLE"
                },
                "1": {
                  "color": "green",
                  "text": "ELIGIBLE"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Time since last trade (seconds, -1 before first trade)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pairtrade_time_since_last_trade_seconds{instance!~\"debot-tokyo.*\",variant!=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{variant}} {{pair}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Close reasons (count last 24h)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 37
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (instance, variant, reason) (increase(pairtrade_close_reason_total{instance!~\"debot-tokyo.*\",variant!=\"\"}[24h]))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "instance": 0,
              "variant": 1,
              "reason": 2,
              "Value #A": 3
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "instance": "host",
              "Value #A": "count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {},
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "host"
              },
              {
                "field": "variant"
              },
              {
                "field": "reason"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "filterable": true
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "count"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "gradient"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "continuous-GrYlRd"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.align",
                "value": "center"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Snapshot age (seconds)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 44
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pairtrade_snapshot_age_seconds{instance!~\"debot-tokyo.*\",variant!=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{variant}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 120
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 600
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Close gross PnL \u2014 per close (bps of entry notional)",
      "description": "Per-close gross PnL (price moves only, fees+funding excluded) normalized by entry notional, plotted as scatter (1 point \u2248 1 close). pairtrade closes ~1-2/day per variant; the prior heatmap form (pairtrade#35) was too sparse to show signal. Replaced per bot-strategy#420. Source for #306 BT/live gap analysis. (#314 Group 4-A)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 49
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "increase(pairtrade_close_gross_pnl_bps_sum{instance!~\"debot-tokyo.*\",variant!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval]) / increase(pairtrade_close_gross_pnl_bps_count{instance!~\"debot-tokyo.*\",variant!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{variant}} {{reason}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "points",
            "pointSize": 6,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "lineWidth": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* exit_z$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* expected_value$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* stop_loss_z$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* max_loss_r$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* risk_budget$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "magenta"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* force_close$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "dark-red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* maintenance_preempt$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#5DADE2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* ineligible$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#888888"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* unknown$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#CCCCCC"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Per-leg slippage p50/p90 (bps, by order_type)",
      "description": "Median + 90th-percentile slippage vs decision-time reference price, signed positive = cost. post_only fills typically hover near 0; taker fills are the adverse tail #306 cares about. (#314 Group 4-B/B-2, pairtrade#38/#42)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 49
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, order_type) (rate(pairtrade_leg_slippage_bps_bucket{instance!~\"debot-tokyo.*\",variant!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{order_type}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.9, sum by (le, order_type) (rate(pairtrade_leg_slippage_bps_bucket{instance!~\"debot-tokyo.*\",variant!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p90 {{order_type}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Canary regression detection (bot-strategy#412)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 57
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Canary restart events (24h count via process_start change)",
      "description": "bot-strategy#412 signal #1. `changes(pairtrade_process_start_timestamp_seconds[24h])` = number of restarts in the last 24h. Canary auto-restarts on each CI deploy (#376), so the typical level is 1-3/day. Spikes above 5/day indicate either CI churn or a `Restart=on-failure` loop (the latter is the binary-regression signal). Unexpected-exit details (SIGKILL, timeout) are surfaced separately by the error-watch workflow (#168) as auto-issues.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 58
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "changes(pairtrade_process_start_timestamp_seconds{instance=\"debot-frankfurt-canary\"}[24h])",
          "legendFormat": "canary",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "changes(pairtrade_process_start_timestamp_seconds{instance=\"debot-frankfurt\"}[24h])",
          "legendFormat": "main A/B/C (ref)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Canary / main-A trade rate ratio (24h)",
      "description": "bot-strategy#412 signal #5 supplement. Ratio of canary trade count to main A trade count (`pairtrade_close_gross_pnl_bps_count`). Target >= 2.0 per #376 (canary entry_z=1.0 vs main A 1.5 \u2192 ~2-3x). Below 1.5 means canary stopped trading at its expected aggressive pace, e.g. a binary that silently breaks entry logic.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 58
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(pairtrade_close_gross_pnl_bps_count{instance=\"debot-frankfurt-canary\"}[24h])) / on() group_right sum(rate(pairtrade_close_gross_pnl_bps_count{instance=\"debot-frankfurt\",variant=\"a\"}[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "canary / main-A",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1.5
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 2.0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Canary per-leg slippage p50/p95 \u2014 entry (bps)",
      "description": "bot-strategy#412 signal #4. Canary-only view of `pairtrade_leg_slippage_bps` for the entry leg, split by order_type (post_only vs taker). Positive bps = cost (paid more than reference). Panel 17 above mixes canary into the global `variant!=\"\"` aggregate; this panel isolates the canary path so binary regression in fill quality is visible. Baseline + threshold tuning is bot-strategy#412 Stage B/C (~2026-05-21 \u2192 2026-05-28).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 64
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, order_type) (rate(pairtrade_leg_slippage_bps_bucket{instance=\"debot-frankfurt-canary\",leg=\"entry\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{order_type}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, order_type) (rate(pairtrade_leg_slippage_bps_bucket{instance=\"debot-frankfurt-canary\",leg=\"entry\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{order_type}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Canary per-leg slippage p50/p95 \u2014 exit (bps)",
      "description": "bot-strategy#412 signal #4, exit-leg companion to panel 23. Exit-side slippage is the leg-sync tail that pairtrade#23 / bot-strategy#258 cared about \u2014 for canary the regression signal is the same shape as entry but on the exit path.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 64
      },
      "targets": [
        {
